#23901
In the Bleak Plain~
   The ground is cracked the same way a dry lake bed splits.  Nothing but flat
cracked dirt surrounds you.  South of here a barren expanse opens out to a
great distance.  It is mostly dirt and small rocks, with the occasional patch
of small dead plant life.  There is a large rock formation off to the southeast.
