#23953
Edge of the Great Plateau~
   The ground here is solid stone covered with a layer of loose dirt.  A large
rock formation lies off to the west.  It and the ground here look to be the
same kind of rock.  Immediately to the east this plateau ends abruptly at a
sheer cliff.  Looking east all you see is clear blue sky.  Looking down over
the cliff you see a vast wilderness a few thousand feet below.  The edge runs
